<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight by Torey Malatia, who wants to take this time to introduce you the man who will be hosting our show from now on--
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理监督由托里·马拉蒂亚（Torey Malatia）负责，他想借此机会向你介绍今后将主持我们节目的人——

00:58:35.230 --> 00:58:38.880
<v David>He's the assistant of the head of the coalition, Mr. Ze'ev Boim.
<v David>他是执政联盟负责人泽夫·博伊姆先生的助手。

00:58:38.880 --> 00:58:55.590
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回《这就是美国生活》的更多故事。

